| `change_comments.directives` | list of strings | `["!", "type:", "noqa", "pragma", "fmt:"]` | a non-empty list of non-blank strings, matched lowercased | `tests/integration/test_change_comment_gate.py` (`read_lists`, `opening_phrase`) | Lists the openers of a comment that instructs a tool (a shebang, a type, lint or coverage pragma, a formatter switch); such a comment is skipped and never judged as prose. | suppressing one finding: reword the comment instead | always |
